OL,3,GNEWSAStudent teachers not eligible for
OL,4,A#20,000 support feel 'disheartened'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents training to be teachers in
OL,7,FScience, Maths and Irish who do not
OL,8,Fqualify for support of up to #20,000
OL,9,Ffeel "disheartened" and "disrespected".
OL,11,FStudent teachers at St Mary's
OL,12,FUniversity College in Belfast have
OL,13,Fpresented a proposal to the Department
OL,14,Fof Education (DE) that would see them
OL,15,Fget some financial support for the
OL,16,Fremainder of their course.
OL,18,FThose in Northern Ireland starting
OL,19,Fcourses in September to teach in Irish
OL,20,Flanguage schools and Maths, Science or
OL,21,FTechnology subjects have their tuition
OL,22,Ffees paid.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
