OL,3,GNEWSAStudent teachers not eligible for
OL,4,A#20,000 support feel 'disheartened'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the department said that "funding
OL,7,Fis not available to extend the scheme
OL,8,Fto current undergraduate students".
